---
import BaseHead from '../components/BaseHead.astro';
import Header from '../components/Header.astro';
import Footer from '../components/Footer.astro';
import AboutBanner from '../components/AboutBanner.astro';
import BookBanner from '../components/BookBanner.astro';
import { SITE_TITLE } from '../consts';
---

<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
	<head>
		<BaseHead title={`About | ${SITE_TITLE}`} description="Commercial engineering background behind Practical Code." />
	</head>
	<body>
		<Header />

		<main class="page-container">
			<AboutBanner />

			<div class="content-body">
				<p>
					Welcome! I’m <strong>Jim</strong>, a full-stack and front-end software developer with around 30 years of commercial engineering experience, including nearly two decades as an independent contractor across web and backend architecture.
				</p>

				<p>
					Throughout my career in the UK and internationally, I’ve designed, built, and maintained enterprise applications across various industries—working extensively with modern technologies like <strong>C#, ASP.NET Core, SQL Server, PostgreSQL, Angular, Vue, and React</strong>.
				</p>

				<h2>Why Practical Code?</h2>

				<p>
					Software engineering guides often lean too heavily on abstract theory or superficial "hello world" demos that gloss over production constraints. I created <strong>Practical Code</strong> (and authored <em>Building Your First Shopping Basket: A Friendly Guide to C# and Razor Pages</em>) to bridge that gap.
				</p>

				<p>
					My goal here is to provide clear, hands-on tutorials built from real commercial experience. Whether you're mastering clean architecture, optimizing database access with EF Core, or connecting backend API services with modern front-end frameworks, every guide is designed to give you code you can actually ship.
				</p>

				<h2>Get in Touch</h2>

				<p>
					Explore the latest technical articles on the <a href="/blog">Blog</a>, or check out my practical e-commerce book on Amazon. Let’s build something solid!
				</p>
			</div>
			<BookBanner />
		</main>

		<Footer />
	</body>
</html>

<style>
	.page-container {
		width: 100%;
		max-width: 900px;
		margin: 0 auto;
		padding: 1.5rem 1rem 4rem 1rem;
		box-sizing: border-box;
	}

	.about-hero-banner,
	.content-body {
		width: 100%;
		max-width: 100%;
		box-sizing: border-box;
	}

	.content-body {
		text-align: left;
	}

	.content-body h2 {
		font-size: 1.65rem;
		font-weight: 700;
		color: #0f172a;
		margin: 2.25rem 0 1rem 0;
	}

	.content-body p {
		font-size: 1.1rem;
		line-height: 1.7;
		color: #334155;
		margin-bottom: 1.25rem;
	}

	.content-body a {
		color: #0284c7;
		text-decoration: underline;
	}

	.content-body a:hover {
		color: #0369a1;
	}
</style>